  "url": "https://wiki.idlecorp.xyz/index.php/Steel_mill",
  "wikitext": "{{Facility information table|$150, 250x [[coal]], 500x [[iron]]|$1,200|4x [[coal]], 1x [[iron]]|1x [[steel]]|35 seconds|1.714x [[steel]]|$13.71|$822.86|0.744%|steel mill, steelmill, steel furnace, steelfurnace}}\n[[Category:Facility]]\n\nThe steel mill is a facility that produces 1x [[steel]] every 35 seconds. [[Steel]] is used mainly for Construction Material rather than production input. The List of Buildings that use [[steel]] can be seen below.\n\n1 Iron mine and 1 Coal mine can passively provide enough materials to support (1-2) steel mills.\n\nRecommended build ratio is 4 Iron mine and 1 Coal mine for every 7 Steel mill.\n\nFor every 50x production it'll have 1 excessive [[Iron]] and for every 5x production,  it will have 3 excessive [[Coal]].\n</br>Excess material can be sold or stockpiled in case of bad regional modifiers.\n\n== [[Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Ratio|Ratio]] ==\n[[Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Minimum|Minimum]]: 1 [[Iron mine]] : 1 [[Coal  mine]] : 1 [[Steel mill]]\n==== [[Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Meta_Ratio|Meta Ratio]] ====\n4 [[Iron mine]] : 7 [[Steel mill]]\n</br>1 [[Coal mine]] : 7 [[Steel mill]]\n\n'''Disclaimer: The ratio above is for calculation only. The real value may vary.'''\n\n== Related facilities ==\n'''As construction material'''\n<div style=\"column-count:4;-moz-column-count:4;-webkit-column-count:4\">\n*[[Oil refinery]]\n*[[Bauxite mine]]\n*[[Rubber factory]]\n*[[Gas station]]\n*[[Furniture factory]]\n*[[Aluminum factory]]\n*[[LED factory]]\n*[[Polyester factory]]\n*[[Silicon mine]]\n*[[Bicycle factory]]\n*[[Gold mine]]\n*[[Plastic factory]]\n*[[CCD factory]]\n*[[Glass factory]]\n*[[CPU factory]]\n*[[Clothing factory]]\n*[[Cell phone factory]]\n*[[Coal power plant]]\n*[[Laptop factory]]\n*[[Research chemical factory]]\n*[[Solar power plant]]\n*[[Digital camera factory]]\n*[[Television factory]]\n*[[Gasoline engine factory]]\n*[[Car factory]]\n*[[Logistics center]]\n*[[Retail store]]\n*[[Research facility]]\n*[[Customer support center]]\n*[[HQ]]\n</div>\n\n'''As input'''\n*[[Bicycle factory]]\n*[[Gasoline engine factory]]\n*[[Car factory]]",
