  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"float:right;max-width: 35%;\">\n<caption><small><a href=\"/index.php/Legend\" title=\"Legend\">Need help with the table?</a></small>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Cost\" title=\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\">Cost</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Cost_2\" title=\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\">Cost</a></b></td>\n<td>$150, 250x <a href=\"/index.php/Coal\" title=\"Coal\">coal</a>, 500x <a href=\"/index.php/Iron\" title=\"Iron\">iron</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Total_Cost\" title=\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\">Total Cost</a></b></td>\n<td>$1,200\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Production\" title=\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\">Production</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Consumes_.28Inputs.29\" title=\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\">Inputs</a></b></td>\n<td>4x <a href=\"/index.php/Coal\" title=\"Coal\">coal</a>, 1x <a href=\"/index.php/Iron\" title=\"Iron\">iron</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Produces_.28Outputs.29\" title=\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\">Outputs</a></b></td>\n<td>1x <a href=\"/index.php/Steel\" title=\"Steel\">steel</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Production_interval\" title=\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\">Production interval</a></b></td>\n<td>35 seconds\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Production.2FMin\" title=\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\">Production/Min</a></b></td>\n<td>1.714x <a href=\"/index.php/Steel\" title=\"Steel\">steel</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Profit\" title=\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\">Profit</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Profit_per\" title=\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\">Profit/Min</a></b></td>\n<td>$13.71\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Profit_per\" title=\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\">Profit/Hour</a></b></td>\n<td>$822.86\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Return_On_Investment\" title=\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\">Return On Investment</a></b></td>\n<td>0.744%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Aliases\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">steel mill, steelmill, steel furnace, steelfurnace\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The steel mill is a facility that produces 1x <a href=\"/index.php/Steel\" title=\"Steel\">steel</a> every 35 seconds. <a href=\"/index.php/Steel\" title=\"Steel\">Steel</a> is used mainly for Construction Material rather than production input. The List of Buildings that use <a href=\"/index.php/Steel\" title=\"Steel\">steel</a> can be seen below.\n</p><p>1 Iron mine and 1 Coal mine can passively provide enough materials to support (1-2) steel mills.\n</p><p>Recommended build ratio is 4 Iron mine and 1 Coal mine for every 7 Steel mill.\n</p><p>For every 50x production it'll have 1 excessive <a href=\"/index.php/Iron\" title=\"Iron\">Iron</a> and for every 5x production,  it will have 3 excessive <a href=\"/index.php/Coal\" title=\"Coal\">Coal</a>.\n<br />Excess material can be sold or stockpiled in case of bad regional modifiers.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ratio\"><a href=\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Ratio\" title=\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\">Ratio</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Steel_mill&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Ratio\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Minimum\" title=\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\">Minimum</a>: 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Iron_mine\" title=\"Iron mine\">Iron mine</a>&#160;: 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Coal_mine\" title=\"Coal mine\">Coal  mine</a>&#160;: 1 <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Steel mill</a>\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Meta_Ratio\"><a href=\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Meta_Ratio\" title=\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\">Meta Ratio</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Steel_mill&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Meta Ratio\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>4 <a href=\"/index.php/Iron_mine\" title=\"Iron mine\">Iron mine</a>&#160;: 7 <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Steel mill</a>\n<br />1 <a href=\"/index.php/Coal_mine\" title=\"Coal mine\">Coal mine</a>&#160;: 7 <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Steel mill</a>\n</p><p><b>Disclaimer: The ratio above is for calculation only. The real value may vary.</b>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_facilities\">Related facilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Steel_mill&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Related facilities\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><b>As construction material</b>\n</p>\n<div style=\"column-count:4;-moz-column-count:4;-webkit-column-count:4\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Oil_refinery\" title=\"Oil refinery\">Oil refinery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Bauxite_mine\" title=\"Bauxite mine\">Bauxite mine</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rubber_factory\" title=\"Rubber factory\">Rubber factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Gas_station\" title=\"Gas station\">Gas station</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Furniture_factory\" title=\"Furniture factory\">Furniture factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Aluminum_factory\" title=\"Aluminum factory\">Aluminum factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/LED_factory\" title=\"LED factory\">LED factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Polyester_factory\" title=\"Polyester factory\">Polyester factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Silicon_mine\" title=\"Silicon mine\">Silicon mine</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Bicycle_factory\" title=\"Bicycle factory\">Bicycle factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Gold_mine\" title=\"Gold mine\">Gold mine</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Plastic_factory\" title=\"Plastic factory\">Plastic factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/CCD_factory\" title=\"CCD factory\">CCD factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Glass_factory\" title=\"Glass factory\">Glass factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/CPU_factory\" title=\"CPU factory\">CPU factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Clothing_factory\" title=\"Clothing factory\">Clothing factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Cell_phone_factory\" title=\"Cell phone factory\">Cell phone factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Coal_power_plant\" title=\"Coal power plant\">Coal power plant</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Laptop_factory\" title=\"Laptop factory\">Laptop factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Research_chemical_factory\" title=\"Research chemical factory\">Research chemical factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Solar_power_plant\" title=\"Solar power plant\">Solar power plant</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Digital_camera_factory\" title=\"Digital camera factory\">Digital camera factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Television_factory\" title=\"Television factory\">Television factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Gasoline_engine_factory\" title=\"Gasoline engine factory\">Gasoline engine factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Car_factory\" title=\"Car factory\">Car factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Logistics_center\" title=\"Logistics center\">Logistics center</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Retail_store\" title=\"Retail store\">Retail store</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Research_facility\" title=\"Research facility\">Research facility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Customer_support_center\" title=\"Customer support center\">Customer support center</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/HQ\" title=\"HQ\">HQ</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n<p><b>As input</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Bicycle_factory\" title=\"Bicycle factory\">Bicycle factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Gasoline_engine_factory\" title=\"Gasoline engine factory\">Gasoline engine factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Car_factory\" title=\"Car factory\">Car factory</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261009011042\nCache expiry: 86400\nDynamic content: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 47/1000000\nPreprocessor generated node count: 0/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1105/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 171/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    9.983      1 Template:Facility_information_table\n100.00%    9.983      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key icwiki:pcache:idhash:17-0!canonical and timestamp 20261009011042 and revision id 1653\n -->\n</div>",
